{"title":"Deerhide Arms","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Bear, Small Coral Snake, Antlion Pitling, Coral Snake, Bandit</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 5 · DEX 20 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bear\" title=\"Bear - Normal, 2.0% of recorded drops (2 / 101 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6ea4940d5e77a776b717.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2.0%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"coral-snake-small\" title=\"Small Coral Snake - Normal, 6.3% of recorded drops (1 / 16 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/c2a34945ae8f7285c5c7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Small Coral Snake</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">6.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"antlion-pitling\" title=\"Antlion Pitling - Normal, 0.9% of recorded drops (1 / 111 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/922f1f2a8e0dca1a9c52.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Pitling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.9%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"coral-snake-medium\" title=\"Coral Snake - Normal, 1.2% of recorded drops (1 / 86 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d37b212af105279dd66e.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Coral Snake</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.2%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bandit\" title=\"Bandit - Normal, 0.2% of r